== (a) fresh runner, zero pages, zero checkpoints ==
current_cell=None pages_fetched=0 percent_complete=100.0  <- fresh run reports 100%

== (b) mid-run: pages_fetched=1120 (=140*8), cells barely started ==
pages_fetched=1120 cells=140 -> percent_complete=100.0
pending_cells at that moment: 140 of 140
pages=560 (50% of the guess) -> percent_complete=50.0

== (c) ETA basis ==
eta() before any command('start'): basis=NO_MEASUREMENT_YET measured=False eta_seconds=None
eta() with 10 pages but started_at=None: basis=NO_MEASUREMENT_YET measured=False
eta() after command('start'): measured=True seconds_per_page=0.0000
CLAIM_REPRODUCED=True
